  "page_dict": {
    "alltext": "35.\n43 EXT. PUB - NIGHT\nSUBBA RAJU, dressed in simple formal shirt and jeans, gets\nout of his car, followed by VEERAYYA, a man in his late 30s,\nalso dressed in simple formals. There is one more plains-\nclothed constable in the car.\nSUBBA RAJU\nNuvvikkade undu. Edanna unte phone\ncheyi.\nThe man nods as VEERAYYA pulls a lathi from the car.\nSUBBA RAJU\nEndhuku adhi, manam ikkadiki\nochindhi mandhu kottadaniki\nA little shocked.\nVEERAYYA\nEnti Sir?\nSUBBA RAJU gives a sarcastic smile\nSUBBA RAJU\nAdhe.. Mundhu mandhedhaam\nVEERAYYA\nTharavaatha\nSUBBA RAJU\nPubbu kadha, chindhedham\nVEERAYYA\nAa taravaata\nSUBBA RAJU\nMalli mandhesi alochiddam\nVEERAYYA stares at him\nSUBBA RAJU\nDialogue bagundhi kada note\nchesipettu.\nThey walk in, when the bouncer tries to stop them. SUBBA RAJU\nflashes a smile and shows his police belt under the shirt.\nThe bouncer smiles back apologetically and lets them in.\nSULOCHANA enters right after.\nCUT TO:",
